<title>THAILAND: Thai banker sees interest rates staying high.</title>
<headline>Thai banker sees interest rates staying high.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's interest rate will likely remain high in the near-term as currency volatility continued, a top Thai banker said on Monday.</p>
<p>Olarn Chaipravat, president of Thai Bankers' Association, told reporters the interest rate will come down after the baht stabilised.</p>
</text>
